WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.950
Jump Super Anime Tour '98

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.820
Here he comes!
Here he comes!

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:03.240
Hey, look at that!

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.860
Aunt Mito, I did it!

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:19.280
Aunt Mito!

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:28.580
Would you look at that.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:29.670
What do you think?

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:40.840
He got the Master of the Swamp!
Five grown men couldn't even land 'im!

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:44.390
I didn't think I'd see anyone on this island ever accomplish such a feat, yet...

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:47.480
See? I caught 'im
just like I said I would!

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:49.730
Time to keep your
end of the deal, Aunt Mito!

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:55.230
You should let him him!
It's just an exam.

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:59.610
Gon's got the stuff to
make a swell Hunter, right?

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:01.280
Easy for you to say!

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.870
Yeah, it's easy to say stuff...

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:08.830
But you taught me to be someone who means what they say, Aunt Mito.

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.930
Do as you like...

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:23.850
Thank you!

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:12.390
A foxbear with a cub.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:15.520
Rotten shame,
but it's harmed a human.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:25.110
You idiot!

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:26.570
Look at theses!

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:30.540
Those are the territorial marks of a foxbear with its cub!

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:32.000
They're everywhere!

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:35.000
Didn't your father bother
to teach you anything?!

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:38.920
Damn, it's been a while since I've had to make such a meaningless kill.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:42.220
I should have just ignored the warning call of that speckled squirrel!

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:47.320
I don't have a father
or a mother.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.910
They were killed in an accident
soon after I was born.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:52.270
Sorry about that.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:09.280
What'cha gonna do with the cub?

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.700
Put it down.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:13.910
It hasn't been weaned yet,
so it won't survive long.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:18.420
Even if it did manage, it might bear a grudge against humans for the murder of its mother.

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:23.180
I'll take care of it!

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:25.510
Impossible.
Foxbears are wild to the core.

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:40.440
By chance, was your
father's name Ging?

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:43.070
You know my dad, mister?

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.990
I'm Kite. I'm a Hunter,
for what's that worth.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.640
Ging drilled the basics of
the Hunt into me.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:55.200
And now I'm traveling
around searching for him.

00:05:55.960 --> 00:06:01.420
If I hadn't met him, I would have died
long ago like a dog in some pestilent alley.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.720
Those two aren't dead.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.720
Your eyes have the
same glow as your father's.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:17.730
Looks like you're a little scratched up, but that's a good look for a Hunter.

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.020
Now then...

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:25.690
Kon, I won't see
you after this.

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:27.900
Y'see, I'm gonna be a Hunter!

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:30.410
You get it, right?

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.300
Kon...

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:57.890
Kon, take care of yourself!

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.330
Goodbye.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.380
I'm home.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:33.720
When are you leaving?

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:36.720
Sometime early next week.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:38.640
I see.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:42.140
Did you know this
was also your father's job?

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:44.190
Yeah.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:47.400
He left you, you know!

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:53.240
For him to even leave his child...

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:56.450
...that shows just how amazing the job of being a Hunter is.

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:58.660
Gon.

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:03.120
You really are his son.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:11.550
I'm sorry, Aunt Mito.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:15.510
You're absolutely right.
It's because I'm his son...

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:17.510
...that I'm going to go find him.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:34.780
Gon.

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:37.660
This is it.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:48.960
Bye!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:55.340
Raise the sails!

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:03.520
Gon!!

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.200
Take care!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:17.200
I'll come back
after I become a Hunter.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:24.080
I always knew this
would happen someday.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:29.130
And we would watch him sail off,
with bright eyes just like his father's.

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:36.590
Bye!

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:01.260
A Hunter?

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:04.830
It seems you've
underestimated the profession.

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:11.210
Every year, tens of thousands gather for the Hunter Exam and still only a few pass.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.920
Some even die in
the process, you know.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:16.420
The wind is coming.

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:26.560
It's gonna be a rough one tonight.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.200
This is the captain speaking.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:44.120
The ship will soon pass through monster-inhabited waters.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:47.580
Everyone be on alert
so as not to be attacked.

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:57.800
Monsters?!
Don't make me laugh!

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:03.260
I will explain about the Exam an hour after the monsters start attacking.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:06.520
Those wishing to become Hunters should come above deck.

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:07.390
That is all.

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:10.350
Do you think anyone
will actually come up?

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:13.610
Of course, I am expecting
great things from this lot.

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:15.940
Hey, shut the door properly!

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:16.780
Aye!

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:22.240
Oh yeah, it takes about a week to recover if they get to you!

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:36.000
Right, everyone
to your positions!

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.250
Yessir!

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:42.590
It seems this is as far
as we'll go this year as well.

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:46.810
Oh, there you are! I'm game.

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:49.730
Is it time already?

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:55.190
So what is this Exam
all about then, captain?

00:11:55.190 --> 00:12:00.030
Oh! Two this year, huh?
What happened to the others?

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:03.660
They were overwhelmed by some jellyfish-looking monsters.

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:05.950
It seems like they cause
some intense hallucinations.

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.660
They became a horny
mob for a while.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:15.290
Seriously, I was nearly
embraced by a guy.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:19.920
There's still one left!

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:25.260
That's the last of 'em.

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:29.680
Did you catch them
all by yourself?

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:32.690
Yeah, I'm good at fishing.

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:38.260
What an interesting lad you are!
Come line up!

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:45.200
Right, let's hear your names.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.570
I'm Gon.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.160
My name is Kurapika.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.660
The name's Leorio.

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:54.710
Why do you want
to become Hunters?

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:56.500
Is it something you really want?

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:57.710
I don't have to answer that.

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:58.840
C'mon, answer me.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:01.170
Who are you to be asking?

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:02.340
You're not even an Examiner!

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:05.930
I want to see what
my father's job is like!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:07.260
Whoa there, kid!

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.100
Don't just answer him!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.850
It's fine.
I only told him the reason.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.100
No, it's not fine.

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:14.060
I concur with Leorio.

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:16.350
Hey, you.
How old are you?

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:17.490
Don't just call me
by my first name!

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:22.030
One could simply dodge
the question with a plausible lie.

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:28.070
But I consider lying a sin equal to greed and just as dishonorable.

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:28.570
Hey.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:32.910
Yet, to give an honest answer to someone I don't know...

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:37.460
...is not to me,
a reasonable alternative.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:40.750
The matter is simply too personal.

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:44.970
That's yer view, eh? Then both of you can just get off my ship.

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:45.720
What?

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:47.430
I see it still hasn't sunk in.

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:50.860
The Hunter Qualification Exam
has already begun!

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:54.880
As many people want a Hunter's license as there are stars in the sky.

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:58.520
You think there're enough Examiners to judge 'em all? Not hardly.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:04.070
So people like us are employed to engage you in a battle-like instance.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:07.780
The monsters you just faced
were part of the Exam.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:10.490
You three are the only ones who have not already failed.

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:17.210
So I hope you understand that it's up to me whether you get to take the real Exam.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:18.620
Is that clear now?

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:23.500
The night air seems a bit humid.

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:39.770
Wh-What's that?

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:42.690
Hey!

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:47.780
You're...

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:54.080
I am a survivor
of the Kurta Clan.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:15:00.210
I want to become a Hunter to capture the ones who slaughtered my brethren four years ago.

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:02.320
So you're out for revenge?

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:04.750
You don't have to be
a Hunter to do that.

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:07.050
I have no intention
of responding to you, Leorio.

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:08.760
What?! You bastard!

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:12.140
Stop it!
Leorio, what is your goal?

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:16.600
It's money! If you have money, you can obtain anything!

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:19.520
You cannot obtain life
with money, Leorio.

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:23.480
That's the third time.
Look here, Kurapika.

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:27.610
I'll eradicate that filthy
Kurta Clan's bloodline!

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.030
You've gone far enough, Leorio!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:32.910
It's "Mr. Leorio!"

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.160
Wait a second.

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:35.830
It's pointless trying to stop me.

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.080
Not trying to stop you,
but check out the wind.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.250
The wind?

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:46.800
What's this all about?

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:57.220
They're saying
a monster is coming.

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:00.520
You understand what
the birds are saying?

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:02.600
Not everything, but enough.

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:04.730
Right, this test is over!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:06.440
Men, to your positions!

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:09.690
We've got to get out of here
as soon as possible!

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:12.400
Captain, there is no one
keeping watch at the bow!

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:17.870
There's also no one
holding the wheel!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:20.580
A monster?
Sounds fun...

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:23.620
But I've got business
to finish up here first.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.380
Hey!

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:36.640
Here it comes!

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:21.540
How many are there?

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.060
Take a closer look.

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:26.180
What is that?

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:31.980
This is terrible. Another
unthinkable horror has appeared.

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:44.120
Apologize now,
and I'll forgive you, Leorio!

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.540
You first, Kurapika!

00:17:56.480 --> 00:17:57.630
What's that?!

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:02.840
Here I come!

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:03.560
Bring it!

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:08.650
Hey! Don't act so recklessly!

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:10.690
Goddammit!

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:13.980
Everyone of them is ignoring
the captain's orders.

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:20.320
Hey! Be careful!

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:37.380
Wow!

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:40.840
Here it goes...

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:50.030
Return all of the people
you swallowed!

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.380
H-Hey...

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:16.380
I'm fine.

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:24.170
Shit!

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:25.140
I'm going after it again.

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.310
Wait!

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:28.690
There's no way you could
beat that thing out there.

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:29.770
Leave the rest to me.

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:30.480
Captain?

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:35.940
You eyeball-covered bastard!
This is the end of your rampage on my ship!

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:39.360
Open your eyes
and get a load of this!

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:41.320
Now! Pull!

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:54.630
How's that?! With your eyes blocked, you can't use your magic!

00:20:09.920 --> 00:20:10.430
Hey!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.750
You're so impulsive!

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.980
You can't just run in
headfirst like that!

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:36.360
Thanks for the help, you two.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:38.170
No problem...

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.050
Here it comes.

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:44.130
So what now?!

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.050
Are you alright?

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:48.720
That thing becomes
gigantic during a full moon.

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:53.730
The legend says that if you cover its eyes, its magic disappears as well.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.240
Did we fail?

00:20:55.240 --> 00:20:55.650
Its eyes?

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:00.940
If that's the case,
then what you did won't work.

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:02.860
Could you both distract him?

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:06.450
Please do that
and leave the rest to me.

00:21:08.710 --> 00:21:09.560
No choice.

00:21:09.560 --> 00:21:10.450
Got it.

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:11.080
Let's go!

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:11.760
Right!

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:29.600
Take this!

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:33.100
Stand back!

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:38.360
Here it goes!

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:50.080
Just where are you aiming?!

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:01.290
He's nuts!

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:23.610
What's happening?

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:24.780
Did he do it?

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:36.620
Yeah! He did it!

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:44.460
Are you okay?

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:48.260
Huh? What is that?

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:49.340
Don't tell me that's...

00:22:49.340 --> 00:22:52.510
Yeah, this is what the
monster really looks like.

00:22:52.510 --> 00:22:54.310
And these are its eyes.

00:22:54.310 --> 00:22:55.770
Eyes?

00:22:57.680 --> 00:22:59.850
You saw them from that far away?

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:01.730
Yeah, you didn't?

00:23:01.730 --> 00:23:04.400
He was staring at us
the whole time!

00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:07.630
Did you notice?

00:23:07.630 --> 00:23:08.490
Not at all.

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:10.910
Thanks, you guys.

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:19.290
I like you lot.

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:22.750
I feel great today.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:27.260
I shall take it upon myself to deliver you to a port near the Examination venue.

00:23:27.260 --> 00:23:29.170
Become great Hunters!

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:33.720
Yes!

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:34.510
We did it!

00:24:10.920 --> 00:24:15.760
Original Work　　　Yoshihiro Togashi
